cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use this software, please cite it using the metadata below."
title: "thermal-energy-storage-1d: A 1D finite-volume model of a stratified thermal energy storage tank"
abstract: >-
  A 1D finite-volume model of a stratified hot-water thermal energy storage
  (TES) tank, designed for coupling with district heating network simulation
  tools. Features explicit and implicit time integration, upwind and TVD
  advection schemes, convective adjustment, flexible hydraulic and heat-exchanger
  ports, and validation against the Dronninglund and Høje Taastrup pit thermal
  energy storage sites.
